{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kogane.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "面试室里的长崎口音",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kogane.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kogane.first",
    "idolId": "kogane",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（今天要见的，是面试室里那位。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "失礼了！月冈恋钟，19岁ばい！……啊，是、是！今天请多指教！",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "请多指教。听说你从长崎来？",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "嗯！我是长崎佐世保来的！刚上京，口音还没改掉呢",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "不过长崎真是很好的地方啊～！鱼新鲜又好吃，人也都温柔！",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "听起来不错。……试镜的时候，我就记住你了。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "真的吗！？好开心～！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "不过……其实我试镜全都落选了。一个都没过……",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……全部？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "嗯。不过没关系！我是为了当偶像才出生的，落选这点事不算什么！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "有沮丧的工夫，不如练习练习ばい～！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……这份劲头，不是装出来的。）那，要不要一起以顶级偶像为目标？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "诶……真的？真的真的？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "太好了！终于，我也是偶像たい～！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "是！请多指教～！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
